msgstr "LeddarTech LeddarVu8"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:7
#: 40e31240d2794465a1b447c42386b149 4a366da4ad8b414d99bb21bc74f6a97b
#: 6421483efc15436abaf84243b2272cc4 9942df1031394ed1a34993274e7baa6d
#: c5ef27e3f02340c4b7b3e1bac528c015
msgid ""
"The `LeddarTech LeddarVu8 <https://leddartech.com/lidar/leddar-vu8-solid-"
"state-lidar-sensor-module/>`__ is a long range (185m) lidar which provides 8"
" individual distances within a 16deg to 99deg field of view depending upon "
"the model used.  ArduPilot always uses the shortest of the 8 distances "
"provided."
msgstr ""
"`LeddarTech LeddarVu8 <https://leddartech.com/lidar/leddar-vu8-solid-state-"
"lidar-sensor-module/>`__ 是一款远程（185m）激光雷达，根据使用的型号，在 16 度到 99 度的视野范围内提供 8 "
"个独立距离值。ArduPilot 始终使用这 8 个距离中最短的一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:14
#: 0349018c51124f6fbe9d31fbcdc8797a 1140f819a0e14699b435ca9e52608d77
#: 50db419f244a4da686b6d0017c829146 76cbf1ad30d44a31a30d97a90cbb12ac
#: c94102693fd24dd7ade94ca4d08afe5f
msgid "Support for this sensor was released with Copter-4.0.4"
msgstr "对该传感器的支持从 Copter-4.0.4 开始发布"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:17
#: 22d18937f33246d39e491d9562cb7d2d 24f77b13773f438c86a29bde9928605a
#: 8a4ebd22a426470a91be05b56adf9c0a b24316164c8c4fcab66206cb7a5de9a2
#: dda6cb6dca1b4d04b66c6b1d0e3aea23
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:19
#: 750c6ff489a643bba0aff5811cf0a385 92beddaf7e1242c3a2042ae60d34bef2
#: 986b160524ec4a1084ec46688f4cd70b be8ff012d8994703bdf89d06ab0d40c3
#: f4de47d3c1484a6d9653a338dba14a44
msgid ""
"Any of the autopilot's spare serial ports may be used.  The diagram below "
"shows how to connect the sensor's TX, RX and GND pins assuming Serial2 is "
"used."
msgstr "可使用飞控上任何空闲的串口。下图显示了假设使用 Serial2 时，如何连接传感器的 TX、RX 和 GND 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:23
#: 134d820f40d84713bf5ad192ec4a2b74 3b752544428a4c39934e36ff47a2a648
#: 5b3218f8be6c40a4a72efdb3fba4fcd5 6db95373a1a44666a3cae6f679f9fc8b
#: e2c8110830a847de82a59f8522e0ca3a
msgid ""
"The lidar must be powered separately with a stable 12V source.  During "
"testing the lidar was unable to reliably provide distances if the voltage "
"dropped below 11V."
msgstr "激光雷达必须单独使用稳定的 12V 电源供电。测试中发现，当电压低于 11V 时，激光雷达无法可靠提供距离数据。"

