msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leddartech-leddarvu8-lidar.rst:28
#: 189a1081c8a64509b8110d81775ecfca 26c89da032454310ba81605f97e4ca0c
